Use exactly one of the two routes: the same row id inserted twice fails boot.
For a local checkout, a link dependency keeps edits live across restarts:
jsonc
// ~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "dsh-plugin-pi-ui": "link:/absolute/path/to/dsh-plugin-pi-ui"
  }
}
```
